WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.320
Misa-chan...

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.760
You don't need to hide it, indeed.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:11.070
You're not human anymore, indeed!

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.540
What?

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.550
We're not human?

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.490
What do you mean?

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.680
Uh, well...

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.800
You've evolved past humanity.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.050
Indeed.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.760
Who are you two?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.180
Misa-chan, what do you know?

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.640
I'm a Scooper, indeed.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.600
What do you mean?

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.080
You said you were kidnapped by the 
Scoopers while you were in America.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.420
Didn't the Scoopers take you because 
their planet has no culture,

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.900
and they lack the power to create it and 
thought humans could create it for them?

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.240
Right? Right?

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:06.330
This has all been to bring Scoopers 
capable of creativity back home with us.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:13.920
Until now, you've needed to eat the Scoopers 
to have the strength to fight them.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.300
Eating them allowed you to gain their power.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:22.890
Simultaneously, you've been becoming 
something other than human.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.500
Eventually you will become Scoopers.

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:34.190
Since the Scoopers cannot create 
their own culture, they need you.

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:41.410
And to survive in space, 
you must become Scoopers, too.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.530
Are you two okay?

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:54.420
Of course not!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.690
I'd hug anyone who could be okay 
under these circumstances.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.710
Or are you saying that you're okay?

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.550
I'm not, either. I can't draw.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:10.350
Even ideas would turn tail 
and run from this situation.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:14.980
I can't believe we're becoming 
something not human, of all things.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:20.940
I can't believe Misa-chan's a Scooper, too.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.280
This can't be!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.880
Once you become Scoopers,

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:32.260
you'll be able to exercise your 
creativity to your heart's content.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:37.420
It will be like a spring break 
that goes on forever.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:44.340
Ah, yes. Strong Scoopers are 
capable of mimicry, too.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:50.060
For example, your faces can adapt 
to look cute to everyone.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.730
There you are!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.950
Your shop was closed. What's going on?

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.280
Your customers are worried.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.370
Sayumin hasn't noticed, has she?

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:17.080
What's going to happen to us 
when we become Scoopers?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:30.760
Will the three of us not be 
able to run Park anymore?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.970
Is this any time to be talking about Park?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:37.920
In the first place, I don't want 
to look like those Scoopers!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:49.250
Are we losing our creativity 
because we're becoming Scoopers?

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:54.700
Hang on. I just realized something.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:58.220
Scoopers steal culture, don't they?

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:02.420
Maybe we've been doing the same thing.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:07.340
Maybe we weren't copying what's popular 
because we're turning into Scoopers,

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.280
but because we never were creative.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:12.550
Wait, Kotoko.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:16.560
Is that how you felt about our creativity?

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:22.340
Depending on how you look at it, 
my knowledge didn't come from me, either.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.690
I was just copying and pasting from wikis.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:31.710
Mari-chan, aren't you copying 
someone else when you dance?

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:35.580
Maybe we're not any different 
from the Scoopers.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:45.630
Seems like frillier designs 
are more popular right now.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.200
Are you interested in that jacket?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:51.660
Firmer fabrics are popular 
right now, so I got some.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.220
Isn't it cute?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.300
I've thought about a spring 
break that never ends.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:02.370
About conducting research 
with quality instruments

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:08.940
at the home I love, with the 
two of you always beside me,

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.110
without anyone bothering us...

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:11.700
Stop!

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:15.230
The Scoopers are a bunch of 
savage aliens who only steal!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.620
We're different!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:22.870
But if we're not creative either, 
then I'd rather do more research!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.590
You never change, Kotoko!

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:28.780
When you're focused on yourself, 
you lose sight of everything else!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.180
You don't understand how I feel at all!

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:36.450
Sorry...

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.820
Did you make these drawings on the wall?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.000
I was secretly a fan!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.780
They're cool.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:08:01.060
Is it really that bad to copy 
and study the things you admire?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:07.000
If the three of us work together, 
I'm sure we can be creative again.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.580
So you agree, Rito.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.740
You're lucky you can draw by yourself.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.020
I never said...

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:33.030
Mari?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.340
Mari scary!

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.610
Face scary!

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:44.030
Leave me alone!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:44.900
Mari!

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:02.810
What's going to happen to us 
when we become Scoopers?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:07.900
Will the three of us not be 
able to run Park anymore?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.490
Aren't you copying someone 
else when you dance?

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:15.030
Maybe we're not any different 
from the Scoopers.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:19.110
I don't want to be a Scooper!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:26.770
I'm an idol.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.290
I'm going to become an actress.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:34.510
Followers

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.820
My followers are...

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.420
No... Why?

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:38.140
I thought we didn't have internet.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.470
Did they find out?

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.680
Seriously? Her?

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:50.900
That's crazy.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.400
What a shock. I don't like her anymore.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:59.310
No!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.370
Sayumin, have you seen Mari?

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.580
No. Did something happen?

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.740
Yeah...

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.000
Oh? Did you have a fight?

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:17.410
So you agree, Rito.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.300
You're lucky you can draw by yourself.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.100
Give me a minute.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:28.310
Ta-da!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.340
Sakuramochi...

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.240
I just got some at a friend's shop.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.190
Want some?

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.610
Thanks.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.600
Good.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.290
If you still have an appetite, 
you must be okay.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:51.920
I was worried since you guys seemed down earlier.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:05.320
I was really happy that 
they liked my drawings.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:12.270
But there's nothing I can say to them.

00:11:13.510 --> 00:11:17.730
Like I told you before, 
I'm not confident, either.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:22.340
But... I can work at Park because of them.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:27.680
I want to keep working 
with them at Park, but...

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.250
But...

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.820
Leave me alone!

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:40.840
Maybe we're just too different.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.460
You're like a sakuramochi.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:46.180
Huh?

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:51.520
The pickled leaf and sweet mochi 
taste totally different, right?

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:57.550
But sakuramochi is delicious because 
of the harmony of its flavors.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:03.610
Maybe you're creating the harmony of 
Park by being different and unique.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:09.620
Why don't you tell them how you feel?

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:13.080
It'd be nice to see all kinds 
of girls wear our clothes.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:13.820
Yeah!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.960
Every girl in Harajuku.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.630
I have to find them.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.150
Sayumin.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.590
Can I have these?

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.680
Very well.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.730
That's one three-person friendship to go!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.730
Here you go.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.630
Thanks. I've gotta go.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.070
Rito-chan.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.740
I hope you guys make up.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:45.990
Yeah.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:56.760
Mari-chan would probably go 
to a shop with trendy clothes...

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:59.070
Or maybe a popular sweets shop?

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.550
Or maybe she's at a CD shop 
looking at the newest...

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:06.660
When you're focused on yourself, 
you lose sight of everything else!

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.970
You don't understand how I feel at all!

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:17.050
She's the first friend I ever made,

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.440
and I was terrible to her.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.900
It always happens.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.960
I always lose sight of everything around me.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.730
Kotoko-chan can never read the situation.

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:33.080
She suddenly says weird things all the time.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.660
And she's always making weird stuff.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.300
Mom, look. I made this!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:43.960
Koto-chan, who on earth did you take after?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.220
Dad, look.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:51.740
Kotoko, don't show or say weird things 
to anyone outside this house.

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:08.520
I just wanted to do what 
I like as much as I want.

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:17.440
If I could fill the world with things 
I like with Mari-chan and Rito-chan...

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:23.800
Why?

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:27.010
If everyone stops paying attention to me...

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.930
What should I do?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.140
Those moves are like Ariana Grande's.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.590
Really?

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:40.850
They're super cool!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.810
Wow!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:45.140
How's this?

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.340
I like it.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:47.510
It's cool.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:51.910
Isn't Ariana more like this?

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.440
Mari-chan, that's amazing!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:04.790
I've always received praise and recognition.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:10.220
Mari-chan, aren't you copying 
someone else when you dance?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.350
Maybe we're not any different 
from the Scoopers.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:31.910
I liked being praised by 
Mari-chan and Rito-chan.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.900
Since I tire of things easily,

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:39.200
I think it's great how you can 
focus so closely on a single thing.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:41.910
Yeah. It makes you dependable.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:42.790
We love you.

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.960
I love both of you!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.720
An eternal spring break.

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:51.080
Together forever.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:59.140
Forever and ever and ever.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:03.350
It's nearly time.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.370
Urahara, deploy.

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.130
Why?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:31.590
You can't deploy the Urahara 
because you're not strong enough.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:35.550
At this rate, the city will 
suffer even more damage.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.120
Here, eat this.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:47.400
I need to tell the others.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.020
What?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.360
It's beautiful, indeed.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:58.120
What was she thinking when she made this?

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:03.080
Either way, it's an unstable plant.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:06.070
Why now?

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:09.750
I hate all of you!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:20.930
Wow.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.520
So cool.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:40.160
I need to find the others 
so we can fight together.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.120
Mari-chan, Rito-chan.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.920
Where are you?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.590
Together... together...

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:04.020
Th-Thank you.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.020
This is it.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:30.500
If I tell the others, I'm sure...

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:46.250
Where are they?

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:54.610
If I'm not with Mari-chan 
and Rito-chan, I'll...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.060
Thanks!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.830
Wow, thank you!

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:15.800
You were awesome!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.800
<i>More...</i>

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:19.800
<i>More...</i>

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.800
<i>Tell me more!</i>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.480
Are these from Scoopers? Who did this?

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:35.690
Mari-chan? Rito-chan?

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.130
Where are you? Where are you?

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.150
Where are you?

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.960
You can do it!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.170
You have our support!

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.080
Good luck!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.440
I'm going to copy her fashion!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:23.860
She's so cute! I love her!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.070
More...

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.300
It's not enough.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:33.210
More... more... more...

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.580
I need more...

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:57.060
I found you, Mari-chan.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.020
Sorry about earlier.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:04.740
I want to be with you.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.540
With you forever.

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:11.740
Mari-chan.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.780
I need to tell the others.

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:26.680
If the three of us run Park 
together, I know we can...

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:27.640
Huh?

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:32.560
Why?

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:27.960
I'm an idiot. A huge idiot.

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:29.210
What's wrong?

00:23:29.210 --> 00:23:32.260
No matter how many times I walk 
through Urahara, I still get lost.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:36.930
That's because you stop at cute 
and delicious shops all the time.
